I registered an instance via a Java client and set its enabled to false. Subsequently, I used the console to reactivate the instance. When the process exits and restarts quickly (followed by re-registration), the instance no longer retains enabled true. However, if the process remains exited for more than 1 minute, no such issue occurs.

register
